RawStr ← &fras "./input.txt"
Lines  ← ⊜∘⊸(¬∊"\n\r")RawStr
Step   ← ⟜(⊃(↘+1⊢⊚⊸=|˜⊂⊙◌)⊙⇌/↥⊸↘⊙⇌)-1
SolBy  ← ⋕◌◌⍢(Step|>0)
Sol!   ← /+≡(˜(SolBy^0)"")
Sol!2Lines
Sol!12Lines

┌─╴Test
  ˙⍤ = 1 /×[
    =2
    ⊙(≍"56")
    ⊙⊙(≍"4")
  ] Step 3 "123456" ""
  ˙⍤ = 1 /×[
    =1
    ⊙(≍"6")
    ⊙⊙(≍"45")
  ] Step 2 "56" "4"
  ˙⍤ = 1 /×[
    =0
    ⊙(≍"")
    ⊙⊙(≍"456")
  ] Step 1 "6" "45"
  ˙⍤ = 434234234278 SolBy 12 "234234234234278" ""
